{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj47fMbn6dxh813sxFxR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, unassuming door.*\n\n*But I am not just any door.*\n\n*I am the door that requires a key.*\n\n---\n\nThere is a keyhole. Brass, tarnished at the edges, cold to the touch. The kind that has waited a long time.\n\nYou can feel the faint draft coming through from the other side — air that smells like dust and forgotten things.\n\nI do not move. I do not yield. I do not negotiate.\n\n**Insert the key or walk away.**\n\n🔒"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":126,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}